    "medication": "simvastatin",
    "condition": null,
    "topic": "dosage reference",
    "text": "The DailyMed simvastatin tablets label states that simvastatin is taken orally once daily in the evening and identifies 40 mg once daily as the maximum recommended dosage in the highlighted information.",
