    "medication": "simvastatin",
    "condition": null,
    "topic": "contraindication and warning",
    "text": "The DailyMed simvastatin tablets label lists strong CYP3A4 inhibitors among contraindicated concomitant uses and warns that simvastatin may cause myopathy and rhabdomyolysis.",
