    "condition": "hypertension",
    "topic": "indication and dosage",
    "text": "The DailyMed losartan potassium tablets label states that the product is indicated for treatment of hypertension and lists a usual adult starting dose of 50 mg once daily, with a maximum dose of 100 mg once daily as needed.",
