    "medication": "losartan",
    "condition": null,
    "topic": "monitoring and warning",
    "text": "The DailyMed losartan potassium tablets label warns about fetal toxicity and states that drugs raising serum potassium may result in hyperkalemia; it advises monitoring serum potassium in that context.",
